    Bring the seat prompt into line with enacted Act 25: the office is Executive, not legislative
    
    government/sitting.sh briefed every seat that the innovation office is 'the permanent
    legislative Innovation Centre', while the same prompt's appended status block reports
    'legislative_branch: false'. Act 25 s1-s3 terminated the legislative location and sponsorship
    and forbid Parliament directing, summoning or treating the office as a legislative originator.
    
    Only this paragraph changes. Re-derived from current main; not resurrected from the
    unauthorised hold-gate draft that happened to carry a similar hunk.

